        "description": {
            "value": "<p>A picture is worth a thousand words, but a recording can tell epic tales. You're constantly looking for the little moments that convey the big story, whether it's recording the perfect shot or deriving meaning in the editing room.</p>\n<p>Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to <strong>Wisdom</strong> or <strong>Charisma</strong>, and one is a free attribute boost.</p>\n<p>You're trained in the Performance skill and a Lore skill of your choice related to your subject of study. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.feats.Item.Hit Record] skill feat.</p>"
